translate pt strings:

    old "A few plumes of smoke rose up, suggesting at least some still lived there."
    new "Alguns poucos fumaças subiram, sugerindo que pelo menos alguns ainda viviam lá."

    old "A passing army drew some attention, but they were a curiosity to the people here."
    new "Uma passagem de tropas atraiu a atenção, mas eram uma curiosidade para o povo daqui."

    old "A few greeted her, many more were already too deep into their drinks."
    new "Alguns a cumprimentaram, muitos mais já estavam demasiado embriagados para se importar."

    old "A large, burly man stormed into the room. The town blacksmith, perhaps, Sarah thought by his appearance."
    new "Um homem grande e forte entrou correndo na sala. O ferreiro da cidade, talvez, pensou Sarah ao vê-lo."

    old "A man ran out and soon returned with the tools that had been requested."
    new "Um homem saiu e logo retornou com as ferramentas que haviam sido solicitadas."

    old "Offer to help hunt the Beast"
    new "Oferecer ajuda na caçada ao Monstro"

    old "Refuse, only give them medical supplies"
    new "Recusar, dar apenas suprimentos médicos"
